<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Friday's matches:</p>
<p>5 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille)</p>
<p>4 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon)</p>
<p>3 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Vladimir Smicer (Lens), Jean-Philippe Durand (Marseille), Xavier</p>
<p>Gravelaine (Marseille), Robert Pires (Metz), Enzo Scifo</p>
<p>(Monaco), Saib Moussa (Auxerre), Christopher Wreh (Guingamp)</p>
</text>
